\newlabel{fig:protocol}{{1}{4}{The audit-grade pipeline: accessible evidence ($E_{\mathrm {hard}}$, green) drives rollouts, signed replay, the shadow candidate, and the pre-commit gate; the official hidden evaluator ($R_{\mathrm {hidden}}$, red) scores episodes offline and never enters the update loop}{figure.caption.8}{}}
